1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,679
And the vascular tissue.

2
00:00:01,679 --> 00:00:10,273
Xylem and phloem lie in separate strips, on alternate radii: xylem arms, with phloem patches between them.

3
00:00:10,273 --> 00:00:11,979
That is a radial arrangement.

4
00:00:11,979 --> 00:00:18,502
And the xylem is exarch, with the small protoxylem at the tips of the arms, on the outside.

